    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Multi-source BFS</span><span class=\"chip\">Grid</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/rotting-oranges/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 994</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Rotting Oranges</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Insight in one line: put every rotten orange in the queue at minute 0 and run one BFS; each queue level is one minute, so the answer is the number of levels needed to reach the last fresh orange (or -1 if some are never reached). O(m·n) time and space.</p>\n"
